 with / and %, exposing a large, deeply cascaded\\narithmetic network to Gowin synthesis. Shortening this network can\\nimprove every CoreMark cycle even when that cycle does not divide.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace just the real DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU implementation in alu.sv with\\none shared, fully combinational radix-4 restoring divider. It produces\\nquotient and remainder together in 16 unrolled steps\n…[25464 of 28536 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:9159c225e493c247]…\n each bus stall, including multiple data-stall cycles, wrong-path stores and reset after training. Check architectural PCs, RVFI order, absence of wrong-path side effects, one-shot training, and elimination of warm correctly predicted taken-branch bubbles without removing existing coverage.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 12.76, \"delta_pct\": 5.28, \"vs_baseline\": 5.28, \"fmax_mhz\": 5.347, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4190281, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 12530, \"ff\": 684, \"seeds\": [5.251, 5.347, 5.347], \"perturbations\": [[0, 5.251, 141], [1, 5.347, 141], [2, 5.347, 141]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_0_s100\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -185.43, \"arrival_ns\": 195.725, \"logic_cells\": 163, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 141, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T14:20:30.446943Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 1}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
