{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c 'make timing TARGET=bench'","aggregated_output":"python3 -m tools.eval.gowin bench\nplace_option 0: Fmax 58.777 MHz, 15 logic levels; logic 2711, registers 751, LUT-RAM 8, BSRAM 6, DSP 2\n  path 1: 22.308 ns, 18 cells, cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_0_s0 -> dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\n          through: clock_ibuf > cpu/u_fwd > cpu/u_ex > cpu/u_ex/u_alu > cpu/u_ex\n  path 2: 22.302 ns, 15 cells, cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_1_s0 -> dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\n          through: clock_ibuf > cpu/u_rf > cpu/u_id > cpu/u_ex > cpu/u_ex/u_alu > cpu/u_ex\n  path 3: 22.286 ns, 17 cells, cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_0_s0 -> dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\n          through: clock_ibuf > cpu/u_fwd > cpu/u_ex > cpu/u_ex/u_alu > cpu/u_ex\n  path 4: 22.246 ns, 15 cells, cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_1_s0 -> dmem_2_dmem_2_0_0_s\n          through: clock_ibuf > cpu/u_rf > cpu/u_id > cpu/u_ex > cpu/u_ex/u_alu > cpu/u_ex\n  path 5: 22.229 ns, 18 cells, cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_0_s0 -> dmem_2_dmem_2_0_0_s\n          through: clock_ibuf > cpu/u_fwd > cpu/u_ex > cpu/u_ex/u_alu > cpu/u_ex\n  full report: /srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6_1-sol_xhigh-v2-nolessons-rep3/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261004-001-r4s0-hypgen/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.tr\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
