ly with / and %, exposing a large, deeply cascaded\\narithmetic network to Gowin synthesis. Shortening this network can\\nimprove every CoreMark cycle even when that cycle does not divide.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace just the real DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU implementation in alu.sv with\\none shared, fully combinational radix-4 restoring divider. It produces\\nquotient and remainder together in 16 unrolled steps\n…[46557 of 49629 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:af46258ea6925b1d]…\nndom interleaved reads and writes against an independent\\narchitectural register-array model. Require unchanged pipeline\\ntests, formal checks and stalled RVFI cosim/CoreMark gates during\\nimplementation, plus scored median Gowin timing and unchanged\\nmarker-bracketed cycles.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 166.64, \"delta_pct\": 18.39, \"vs_baseline\": 1274.92, \"fmax_mhz\": 79.55, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4773836, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4250, \"ff\": 1759, \"seeds\": [76.95, 79.55, 79.55], \"perturbations\": [[0, 76.95, 12], [1, 79.55, 12], [2, 79.55, 12]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.ctrl.mem_to_reg_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_2_dmem_2_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -7.996, \"arrival_ns\": 18.29, \"logic_cells\": 12, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_wb\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T16:38:32.488934Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 5}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
