{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_4", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n 'timing|gowin|fpga|lint|cocotb|test-unit|cosim' Makefile; rg --files cores/bench/test fpga tools/eval cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses; cat cores/bench/core.yaml; cat CLAUDE.md\"", "aggregated_output": "1:.PHONY: help lint test test-infra cosim formal fpga timing next loop report bench clean\n53:CORE_TARGETS := lint test cosim cosim-build formal formal-deep fpga next loop\n77:\t@echo \"  make lint TARGET=v1     — verilator lint over cores/<TARGET>/rtl/*.sv\"\n78:\t@echo \"  make test TARGET=v1     — cocotb unit tests under cores/<TARGET>/test/\"\n79:\t@echo \"  make cosim TARGET=v1    — RVFI cosim against Python ISS\"\n82:\t@echo \"  make fpga TARGET=v1     — FPGA fitness eval (Gowin Fmax + CoreMark cycles)\"\n83:\t@echo \"  make timing TARGET=v1   — Gowin Fmax and worst paths (placement option 0)\"\n94:# verilator lint over $(RTL_DIR)/.\n97:lint:\n99:\t  verilator --lint-only -Wall -Wno-MULTITOP -sv +incdir+$(RTL_DIR) \\\n103:\t  echo \"lint: no source files in $(RTL_DIR)/\"; \\\n112:cosim: cosim-build bench/programs/selftest.elf bench/programs/coremark.elf\n113:\tpython3 -m tools.eval.cosim . $(TARGET)\n115:cosim-build: $(wildcard $(RTL_DIR)/*.sv) test/cosim/main.cpp\n116:\tbash test/cosim/build.sh\n135:# FPGA timing and area come from the vendor flow, Gowin EDA\n136:# (tools/eval/gowin.py); V2 does not synthesize with Yosys.\n137:fpga: cosim-build bench/programs/coremark.elf\n138:\tpython3 -m tools.eval.fpga . $(TARGET)\n140:timing:\n141:\tpython3 -m tools.eval.gowin $(TARGET)\n178:\trm -rf test/cosim/sim_build sim_build out\nfpga/core_bench_si.sv\nfpga/constraints/Tang_Nano_20K.cst\nfpga/constraints/clock.sdc\nfpga/bench_stall_gen.sv\nfpga/core_bench.sv\nfpga/scripts/synth.tcl\nfpga/scripts/nextpnr_run.sh\ntools/eval/holdout.py\ntools/eval/gowin.py\ntools/eval/formal.py\ntools/eval/test_gate_sanity.py\ntools/eval/_subprocess.py\ntools/eval/test_hol