smatch_grants field. Keep predicted_taken, alignment, recovery operand and every architectural/RVFI field intact.'},\n{'file':'rtl/id_stage.sv','description':'Predecode and register the six complete complementary branch-predicate grants from validated branch funct3 and the accepted predicted_taken bit. Reset grants to zero; capture on the existing payload edge and hold with the consumer.'},\n{'file':'rtl/ex_stage.sv','description':'Replace encoded mismatch selection with parallel granted comparisons and OR reduction over the original forwarded operands. Preserve actual-outcome reconstruction, trap/alignment gating, one-shot registered recovery, lane reuse, training metadata and producer/M ownership semantics.'},\n{'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'Preserve all architectural checks and adapt only bundle bit-offset introspection to the wider internal grant field. Verify exact one-hot/zero grants for all six legal predicates and both prediction directions, reset and held metadata. Exercise equality and signed/unsigned boundary operands, direction reversals, bus stalls, load-use, wrong-path suppression, traps, PCs and consecutive RVFI order.'}\n]}\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=88))\nprint('Revised complete predictor hypothesis written.')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Revised complete predictor hypothesis written.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
