s\\nper cycle without attempting an unrelated arithmetic redesign. There are\\nno recorded predictor attempts or distilled lessons for this fixture.\\n\\nReference replay of the canonical compiled 2K, -O3, 10-iteration CoreMark\\nworkload finds 529,588 conditional branches at 158 distinct PCs, with\\n294,425 taken branches, 49,367 JALs and 13,735 JALRs between \n…[154425 of 157497 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:1164b3461f5910c2]…\nking, bit-one faults and predicted-fault PC+4 recovery. Exercise prolonged bus holds, M ownership, reset during validation, once-only links/retirements, saved operands and wrong-path side effects. Require unchanged formal/full-RVFI cosim plus canonical stalled CoreMark and scored Gowin timing.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 224.66, \"delta_pct\": -5.74, \"vs_baseline\": 1753.63, \"fmax_mhz\": 101.387, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4512847, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4881, \"ff\": 2171, \"seeds\": [97.425, 101.387, 101.387], \"perturbations\": [[0, 97.425, 13], [1, 101.387, 13], [2, 101.387, 13]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/arithmetic_result_q_1_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.ctrl.is_illegal_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -5.264, \"arrival_ns\": 15.559, \"logic_cells\": 39, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T21:56:40.421927Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 12}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
