{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The previous predictor reduced CoreMark cycles by 6.7%, but it ran on the older combinational-divider core, so its fitness does not show how prediction performs on the current champion. The champion’s worst path runs through EX redirect, IF masking, hazard logic and back into ID. I’m proposing a compact next-PC predictor with recovery that avoids that feedback path."}}
