ivisor multiple has no set bits at positions W and\\nhigher; explicitly zero-extend both W-bit subtraction operands. This avoids\\nneedless full-width arithmetic at the early steps without truncating\\noverflowing multiples or accepting an invalid subtraction.\\n\\nNormalize operands to unsigned magnitudes only for si\n…[364774 of 367846 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:198ce93039ab24db]…\nt targets, full-width links, rd=rs1/x0, loaded/forwarded bases, prolonged bus stalls, reset and replay before multiply, divide, load and store. Require no speculative M launch or request and exactly one serviced replayed store. Adapt only internal recovery/bypass cycle expectations to this protocol.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 213.47, \"delta_pct\": -10.43, \"vs_baseline\": 1661.3, \"fmax_mhz\": 96.64, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4527071, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4525, \"ff\": 1904, \"seeds\": [93.083, 96.64, 96.64], \"perturbations\": [[0, 93.083, 12], [1, 96.64, 13], [2, 96.64, 13]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/alu_b_sel_1_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/arithmetic_result_q_14_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -5.743, \"arrival_ns\": 16.037, \"logic_cells\": 22, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T22:38:28.360912Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 13}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
