{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"agent_message","text":"The MUL prototype reduced CoreMark from 4,527,071 to 4,279,973 cycles, about 5.46%, while retaining the expected CRCs and passing eight full-RVFI cosim comparisons. Its first timing result was too slow. I’m testing a refinement that registers the low-MUL class in decode to shorten forwarding control, across all three scored Gowin placement options.\n"}}
